[E0405] Error: cannot move `bag`, which is behind a reference
    ╭─[ err/104_closure_moves/main.wip:16:26 ]
    │
 16 │         val taken = move bag        // the closure only borrowed it
    │                          ─┬─  
    │                           ╰─── behind a `&` reference
    │ 
    │ Note: a reference can read a value but cannot take ownership of it
────╯
[E0401] Error: use of moved value `bag`
    ╭─[ err/104_closure_moves/main.wip:24:18 ]
    │
 23 │     val gone = move bag
    │                ────┬───  
    │                    ╰───── `bag` moved here
 24 │     apply((x) => bag.id + x, 2)     // captured after it was moved out
    │                  ─┬─  
    │                   ╰─── used here after the move
    │ 
    │ Note: after `move`, `bag` holds no value until it is assigned again
────╯
